    description: "Per audit-findings 0010 §'Diagnostic findings' #2, four producers emit a use-site Symbol with no companion Edge. Dropping the Symbol would erase the language-level construct (the import / extends / include directive) from the behaviour map. Each needs a redesign decision: (a) introduce a companion Edge (e.g., emit an 'imports' Edge for r_lang library() calls), or (b) accept loss of representation. Affected sites: r_lang.py:215 (library() / require() imports — no companion Edge), astro.py:209 (frontmatter import statements — the imports Edge nearby in astro.py:332 belongs to the separate component_ref Symbol, not the import Symbol; corrected from shape-2 to shape-3 in PR 2 of WI-zarov), make.py:282 (makefile include directives — no companion Edge), blade.py:265 (Blade @extends directives — no companion Edge). After resolution, audit-findings 0010 statuses for import / include / extends advance from UNRESOLVED to PRELIM_RESOLVED. Reference: docs/audits/0010-symbol-kind-cluster-e-edge-label-kinds.md."  # 9924
